@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam class {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Class structure — Reset a forgotten password

class User <<exists>> {
  +Guid Id
  +string Email
  +string DisplayName
  +string PasswordHash
  +UserRole Role
  +DateTimeOffset CreatedUtc
}
enum UserRole <<exists>> {
  Member
  Manager
  Admin
}
User --> UserRole : has

class PasswordResetToken <<new>> {
  +Guid Id
  +Guid UserId
  +string TokenHash
  +DateTimeOffset ExpiresUtc
  +DateTimeOffset? UsedUtc
  +IsUsable(now: DateTimeOffset): bool
}
class RequestPasswordResetCommand <<new>> {
  +string Email
}
class ResetPasswordCommand <<new>> {
  +string Token
  +string NewPassword
  +string ConfirmPassword
}
class RequestPasswordResetCommandHandler <<new>>
class ResetPasswordCommandHandler <<new>>
interface IEmailSender <<new>> {
  +SendAsync(message: EmailMessage): Task
}
User "1" --> "*" PasswordResetToken : resets
RequestPasswordResetCommandHandler ..> RequestPasswordResetCommand : handles
RequestPasswordResetCommandHandler ..> PasswordResetToken : creates
RequestPasswordResetCommandHandler ..> IEmailSender
ResetPasswordCommandHandler ..> ResetPasswordCommand : handles
ResetPasswordCommandHandler --> PasswordResetToken : consumes
ResetPasswordCommandHandler --> User : sets PasswordHash
@enduml
